### Create workout
POST {{baseUrl}}/workouts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Трицепс",
  "date": "2026-11-03T10:00:00Z",
  "notes": "Тяжело"
}

### List
GET {{baseUrl}}/workouts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get
GET {{baseUrl}}/workouts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/workouts/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ноги",
  "date": "2026-11-03T10:00:00Z",
  "notes": "Очень тяжело"
}

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/workouts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}